---
---

<!-- Unbought Representation Banner -->
<section class="unbought-banner" id="unbought">
  <div class="unbought-bg">
    <div class="unbought-pattern"></div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="container unbought-content">
    <span class="unbought-label animate-in" data-i18n="issues.unbought_label">The Democratic Socialist Commitment</span>
    <h2 class="unbought-headline animate-in" data-i18n="issues.unbought_headline">Unbought Representation.</h2>
    <p class="unbought-text animate-in" data-i18n="issues.unbought_text">
      Byron completely rejects corporate PAC money and contributions from large real estate developers, a commitment he has kept since 2015. He only answers to the working-class coalition of the 25th Ward. His campaign is funded by small-dollar donations from neighbors, teachers, union members, and working families. This is what it means to be truly independent.
    </p>

    <div class="unbought-stats animate-in">
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-number">$0</span>
        <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="issues.stat_corporate">Corporate PAC Money</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-divider"></div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-number">$0</span>
        <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="issues.stat_developer">Developer Contributions</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-divider"></div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-number stat-tabular">$27</span>
        <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="issues.stat_avg">Avg. Donation</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="unbought-text animate-in" data-i18n="issues.unbought_press_quote">"Lopez has admirably represented his ward in his first term... Lopez is endorsed."</p>
    <span class="stat-label animate-in" data-i18n="issues.unbought_press_attribution">Chicago Tribune, 2023</span>

    <p class="unbought-kicker animate-in" data-i18n="issues.unbought_kicker">"It takes people and people defeats money."</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Unbought Banner */
  .unbought-banner {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .unbought-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--blue);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .unbought-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0.05;
    background-image: 
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        transparent,
        transparent 60px,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 60px,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 61px
      );
  }

  .unbought-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .unbought-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--gold-soft);
  }

  .unbought-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--cream);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .unbought-text {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #ffffff;
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  /* Stats */
  .unbought-stats {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-2xl);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(251, 226, 186, 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  /* Inspection-stamp frames */
  .stat-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    border: 2px dashed rgba(245, 208, 138, 0.5);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
  }

  .stat-item:first-child {
    rotate: -1.5deg;
  }

  .stat-item:last-child {
    rotate: 1.5deg;
  }

  .unbought-kicker {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--cream);
    rotate: -1deg;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--gold-soft);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(251, 226, 186, 0.7);
  }

  .stat-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 48px;
    background: rgba(251, 226, 186, 0.2);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .unbought-stats {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
      padding: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .stat-divider {
      width: 60px;
      height: 1px;
    }

    .unbought-headline {
      font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    }
  }
</style>
